    "final_answer": "I have gathered comprehensive data. Let me provide the final answer based on my findings.\n\n**Final Summary of EV Charging Near Smithsonian Museum:**\n\n| Charging Station | Address | Drive Time | Walking Distance |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Blink Charging Station** | 1299 Pennsylvania Ave NW | 2 min | 0.4 mi (9 min walk) |\n| **AmpUp Charging Station** | 555 12th St NW | 2 min | 0.4 mi (9 min walk) |\n| ChargePoint Charging Station | 901 G St NW #215 | 4 min | 0.7 mi |\n| EVgo Charging Station (PMI Parking) | 900 New York Ave NW | 5 min | 1.1 mi |\n\n## Final Answer\n\nThe **closest EV charging supported parking to the Smithsonian museum** (specifically the Smithsonian National Museum of Natural History at 10th St. & Constitution Ave. NW) is the **Blink Charging Station at 1299 Pennsylvania Ave NW, Washington, DC 20004**.\n\n**Details:**\n- **Name:** Blink Charging Station\n- **Address:** 1299 Pennsylvania Ave NW, Washington, DC 20004\n- **Distance from Smithsonian:** ~0.4 miles (2 minutes driving, 9 minutes walking via Constitution Ave NW and 12th St NW)\n- **Hours:** Open 24 hours\n- **Phone:** +1 888-998-2546\n- **Website:** blinkcharging.com\n- **Plus Code:** VXWC+GP\n\n**Runner-up Option:** The **AmpUp Charging Station at 555 12th St NW** is equally close at 0.4 miles / 2 minutes driving.\n\n**If you specifically need a named parking facility** (rather than a standalone EV charging station), the closest such place is the **EVgo Charging Station at PMI Parking (900 New York Ave NW)** at 1.1 miles / 5 minutes driving from the Smithsonian.",
